{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124092414592-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124094453\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月24日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該4處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該4處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:55:06.050745+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T01:24:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:14.235789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:48:19.218997+00:00","content_hash":"1a87decea3bba5a76dc55c98b018115d6d6df6590f87ceaa3078447c06e9e74d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:55:06.050745+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}